1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,230
Most of us dream of meeting that special someone.
我们大多数人都梦想着遇到那个心仪之人。

2
00:00:04,230 --> 00:00:11,520
For lack of a better phrase, that Prince or Princess charming who will sweep us off our feet.
套用一句再贴切不过的话来说，就是那个能让我们神魂颠倒的白马王子或白雪公主。

3
00:00:11,520 --> 00:00:18,500
But to quote the old adage from Shakespeare, “The course of true love never did run smooth.”
但正如莎士比亚的那句古老格言所言：“真爱之路，从不平坦。”

4
00:00:18,500 --> 00:00:32,910
Sometimes our dream partner may have an unfortunate surprise to share with us – they may not live in the same town, city, country, or even on the same continent as you.
有时候，我们的理想伴侣可能会带来一个令人遗憾的意外——他们或许和我们不在同一个城镇、城市、国家，甚至不在同一个大洲。

5
00:00:32,910 --> 00:00:41,350
And so some crazy lovebirds decide to enter into a long-distance relationship.
于是，有些为爱痴狂的情侣便决定开启一段异地恋。

6
00:00:41,350 --> 00:00:50,130
We live in a time when the internet facilitates easier interaction with your cherished and treasured potential life partner.
如今，互联网的发展让我们能更轻松地与那个心心念念、视若珍宝的潜在人生伴侣互动。

7
00:00:50,130 --> 00:01:05,580
However, according to the many people who have been in long-distance relationships, there are certain pitfalls that you need to be aware of to enjoy a committed and monogamous relationship over the wires of the net.
但许多有过异地恋经历的人表示，若想通过网络维系一段忠诚专一的感情，你需要警惕一些潜在的陷阱。

8
00:01:05,580 --> 00:01:09,940
Many people are put off by the very idea of it.
很多人一听到异地恋这个词就望而却步。

9
00:01:09,940 --> 00:01:23,360
A lack of intimacy and companionship can act as a deterrent for some, but for those who embrace a digital distance relationship, they must accept that at times they may feel lonely.
缺乏亲密感和陪伴感对一些人来说是阻碍，但对于那些选择开启线上异地恋的人而言，他们必须接受自己有时会感到孤独的事实。

10
00:01:23,360 --> 00:01:36,270
Many of us dream of that inseparable bond, often named as ‘soulmates’, and here are three tips to help you navigate this potentially tricky form of dating.
我们很多人都向往一种密不可分的羁绊，也就是人们常说的“灵魂伴侣”关系，以下有三个小建议，能帮你应对这种可能颇具挑战的恋爱模式。

11
00:01:36,270 --> 00:01:40,070
Firstly, there needs to be trust.
首先，彼此之间需要信任。

12
00:01:40,070 --> 00:01:48,700
Being faithful is a prerequisite in most relationships, but you also need to be able to trust yourself not to stray.
忠诚是大多数感情的前提，但你也要相信自己不会变心。

13
00:01:48,700 --> 00:01:52,080
Part of the challenge is dealing with loneliness.
异地恋的挑战之一就是应对孤独感。

14
00:01:52,080 --> 00:02:00,420
Also, maintaining a level of self-sufficiency and setting goals is another way to help you cope.
此外，保持一定的自给自足能力并设定目标，也是帮助你应对这种状态的另一种方式。

15
00:02:00,420 --> 00:02:07,290
Not only does it mean you keep your independence, but also gives you more to talk about with your partner.
这不仅能让你保持独立，还能让你和伴侣有更多话题可聊。

16
00:02:07,290 --> 00:02:17,500
Lastly, you need a plan – dates when you will see each other again, or where the relationship will lead to: perhaps even marriage.
最后，你们需要一个计划——规划好下次见面的时间，或是这段感情的发展方向：甚至可能是步入婚姻殿堂。

17
00:02:17,500 --> 00:02:32,260
So, long-distance relationships are potentially a difficult situation, but if you do meet Mr or Mrs Right, and they live far away, there are some steps you can take to make life a little easier.
所以说，异地恋确实可能是一种颇具挑战的状态，但如果你真的遇到了那个对的人，而对方又住在远方，你可以采取一些措施，让这段感情之路走得更轻松一些。
